  "goal": "Make OpenDirectory functional through the existing GUI with Entra-like identity administration",
  "features": [
    "Selected person overview, group and role sections with keyboard navigation",
    "Actual own-user group memberships and available groups with server search, pagination and coherent counts",
    "Minimal group metadata without returning other member profiles or IDs in the new endpoint",
    "Actual manual or rule-generated membership provenance; live user enablement and canonical review/rule deadline determine effective status",
    "Explicit group add/remove confirmation against the displayed original group revision and unchanged guarded writer",
    "Selected-person role read, temporary grant and withdrawal through the existing canonical role kernel without copying UUIDs",
    "No self role administration or direct bypass of activation-required PIM roles",
    "Late receipts and pending intent discarded after person, operator or session changes"
  ],
