  "limits": [
    "This is an increment toward the active complete goal, not proof of full Entra feature parity or completion of BR-001–012 / WF-001–005.",
    "Tenant-defined custom roles, OU role scopes, general group role inheritance, SCIM, further company app types and actual agent/MDM/provider workflows remain open.",
    "The selected-person role UI uses existing canonical platform roles; company ownership and group management do not grant role administration.",
    "Group changes do not prove external license or account provisioning. Rule-managed rows in this person UI link to their rule source; existing group API permissions are unchanged.",
    "Native and real OAuth tests use disposable databases; browser interaction tests use synthetic local API fixtures. No personal production login, password, MFA enrollment or personal assignment was performed.",
